claim.claim-text:
• a decoding unit configured to decode a bit stream to generate quantized data;
• a setting unit configured to set, based on a flag that specifies whether or not a difference quantization parameter is present in the bitstream, a current quantization parameter for a current coding block formed by block partitioning, which recursively splits a largest coding block into smaller coding blocks, and set the current quantization parameter for the current coding block based on a value indicating a minimum coding block size for which the difference quantization parameter is set; and
• an inverse quantization unit configured to inversely quantize the quantized data based on the set current quantization parameter.

• decoding a bit stream to generate quantized data;
• setting, based on a flag that specifies whether or not a difference quantization parameter is present in the bitstream, a current quantization parameter for a current coding block formed by block partitioning, which recursively splits a largest coding block into smaller coding blocks, and setting the current quantization parameter for the current coding block based on a value indicating a minimum coding block size for which the difference quantization parameter is set; and
• inversely quantizing the quantized data based on the set current quantization parameter.
